---
import Layout from '@estate/ui/PortfolioLayout.astro';import {nav} from '../../data/nav';import '../../styles/global.css';const p=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Privacy & Demo Notice | ATELIER Estates" description="Demo-only privacy information for a fictional brokerage website." brand="ATELIER / ESTATES" nav={nav(p)} accent="#242423"><section class="page-heading container"><h1>Privacy & demo notice<span class="period">.</span></h1><p>This is a fictitious, public portfolio exercise, not an operating real-estate agency.</p></section><div class="container legal-copy"><h2>Enquiries</h2><p>Without a configured HTTPS submission endpoint, the form checks fields locally and transmits or stores nothing. A future operator must publish its verified identity, contact details, retention terms, consent basis and full policy before collecting real personal data.</p><h2>Campaign information</h2><p>UTM parameters and GCLID may be held temporarily in your browser session to show a potential CRM integration pattern. No third-party analytics are enabled by default.</p><h2>Illustrative data</h2><p>Every illustrated property, developer, price, listing status, address description, and brand is fictional. No client relationship, transaction, or service is represented.</p><a href={p}>← Return to site</a></div></Layout>
